        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.54m x 1.6m \r\nwith hot-press\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 4.61m x 4.56m \r\n\r\n\r\nBalcony - 0.8m x 2.75m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - 2.97m x 2.77m \r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.54m x 1.81m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
