        "Content": "•First-floor one-bedroom apartment\r\n\r\n•Extending to approximately 34.5 sq. m.\r\n\r\n•Bright and well-proportioned accommodation\r\n\r\n•Open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\r\n\r\n•Private balcony overlooking Vernon Avenue\r\n\r\n•Ample parking for residents\r\n\r\n•Double bedroom with excellent natural light\r\n\r\n•Useful storage off the entrance hall\r\n\r\n•Mature and established residential development\r\n\r\n•Excellent Clontarf location close to shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities\r\n\r\n•Within easy reach of Clontarf seafront, St Anne’s Park, Dollymount Strand and Bull Island\r\n\r\n•Well served by public transport, including the 130 Dublin Bus route and nearby DART services\r\n\r\n•Convenient access to Dublin city centre, IFSC and East Point Business Park\r\n\r\n•Heating: Gas\r\n\r\n•BER: C3\r\n\r\n•Annual Management Charge for 2026 is €1,818.88"
